{"t":"MOS","n":"The Mosaic Company","nKo":"모자이크 컴퍼니","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":20.09,"chg":1.43,"chgPct":0.07663,"prev":18.66,"dayH":20.15,"dayL":19.05,"w52H":32.25,"w52L":16.99,"vol":7125602,"avgVol":8772940,"mcap":6386684416,"pe":null,"fpe":16.07,"eps":-3.54,"feps":1.25,"pb":0.57,"div":0.88,"divY":0.0438,"beta":0.86,"short":37344426,"shortPct":0.1559,"shortRatio":3.57,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Basic Materials","sKo":"기초재료","i":"Agricultural Inputs","iKo":"농업 투입물","city":"Tampa","emp":13249,"web":"https://www.mosaicco.com","sum":"The Mosaic Company, through its subsidiaries, produces and markets concentrated phosphate and potash crop nutrients. It operates in three segments: Phosphates, Potash, and Mosaic Fertilizantes. The company owns and operates mines and production facilities, which produce concentrated phosphate crop nutrients and phosphate-based animal feed ingredients, as well as concentrated phosphate crop nutrients, such as diammonium phosphate, monoammonium phosphate, and MicroEssentials, a value-added ammoniated phosphate product. It also mines, processes, and sells potash to crop nutrient manufacturers, distributors, retailers, and to customers for industrial use; and owns and operates mines, chemical plants, crop nutrient blending and bagging facilities, port terminals and warehouses, which produce an","sumKo":"모자이크 컴퍼니(Mosaic Company)는 자회사를 통해 농축된 인산염 및 칼륨 작물 영양분을 생산하고 판매합니다. 인산염, 칼륨 및 모자이크 비료의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 농축 인산염 작물 영양분과 인산염 기반 동물 사료 성분뿐만 아니라 인산이암모늄, 인산일암모늄 및 부가가치가 높은 암모니아화 인산염 제품인 MicroEssentials와 같은 농축 인산염 작물 영양분을 생산하는 광산과 생산 시설을 소유하고 운영합니다. 또한 칼륨을 채굴, 가공 및 작물 영양제 제조업체, 유통업체, 소매업체 및 산업용 고객에게 판매합니다. 광산, 화학 공장, 작물 영양제 혼합 및 포장 시설, 항구 터미널 및 창고를 소유 및 운영합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":19125200000,"ni":3582800000},{"y":2023,"rev":13696100000,"ni":1164900000},{"y":2024,"rev":11122800000,"ni":174900000},{"y":2025,"rev":12052400000,"ni":540700000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2973700000,"ni":-519500000},{"q":"1Q20